# Scratch directories the tests create next to the manifest. TempDir removes
# them on drop, so these only survive a run that was interrupted before the
# drop could happen - at which point they must not be committable. The trailing
# slash matches directories only, leaving epazote-grafana-dashboard.json alone.
/epazote-*/
